# Task 152-006 Execution Plan

## Objective
CLI Smoke Part 4 — Nervous System + Audit + Feature + Mode (12+ commands) READ-ONLY audit.

## Target commands
1. `deckent --help` (full inventory)
2. `nervous subscribe --help`
3. `nervous status`
4. `nervous accept --help`
5. `nervous reject --help`
6. `nervous config`
7. `audit --help`
8. `audit run` (read-only)
9. `feature-query --help`
10. `feature-query list`
11. `recover --help`
12. `recover --dry-run`
13. `mode --help`
14. `mode` (current)
15. Residual/unmapped commands from full inventory

## Method
- Use `node dist/cli/entry.js <cmd>` or `npx deckent <cmd>` for each.
- Capture exit code, stdout/stderr first ~40 lines.
- Classify each command: PASS | FAIL | REGRESSION | MISSING | DRIFT.
- Destructive commands (kill) NOT to be invoked.
- Write single audit markdown report only.

## Output
- `docs/audits/sprint-152/T-152-006-cli-nervous-audit.md`
- No source code edits.
- Auditor git diff must stay 0 for src/tests/.
